cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "COSMONAUT"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based application for information-driven survey planning. From a probabilistic
  map describing the spatial heterogeneity of a survey area, it computes an optimized
  sampling route over an accessible road network and exports it as an enriched GPX file
  that also marks road segments of high expected information gain. Developed for, and used
  operationally in, mobile cosmic-ray neutron sensing surveys, while the routing workflow
  itself makes no assumption about the instrument. Part of the COSMO Suite and built on
  its reusable framework.
type: software
